# <path><TAB><reason>; a path ending in / covers its subtree. See legacy-reviewer-name.sh.
CHANGELOG.md	release history names the reviewer as it was called when each entry shipped
changelog.d/	unreleased fragments name the reviewer as it was called when each one landed
docs/reference/UPGRADE.md	the GH 1641 upgrade section explains the hard rename and the v51 migration
mcp/trajectory-server/src/db.ts	migrateV50toV51 renames the stored rows
mcp/trajectory-server/src/test/schema-upgrade.test.ts	v50 to v51 migration test seeds legacy rows
mcp/trajectory-server/src/test/fixtures/	historical schema snapshots seed the old agent name
mcp/trajectory-server/dist/	generated from src; dist-fresh.sh keeps it equal to the allowlisted src files
mcp/trajectory-server/src/test/agent-scope.test.ts	SC2: validation_record rejects the pre-rename name and writes no row
tests/fixtures/hook-corpus/git-push-guard/deny-pr-reviewer.json	SC4: a push whose payload names the pre-rename agent is denied
tests/l1-lint/legacy-reviewer-name.sh	this lint
tests/l1-lint/legacy-reviewer-name.allowlist	this allowlist
dashboard/dist/server.mjs	bundles the db.ts v51 migration
